 "gaps": "Full 1-100 order comes from two independent social-media reproductions of The Athletic's ranking (Global Statistics, credited 'The Athletic via Sport Bible'; Rankings de Argentina), which agree on all 100 positions. Planet Football/OneFootball (Dec 2025) independently confirm 9 ranks (Messi 1, Ronaldo 5, Mbappe 29, Modric 36, Neuer 38, Benzema 41, Neymar 46, De Bruyne 66, Salah 67), all matching. Not checked against the printed book or theathletic.com directly (paywalled). Imprint within HarperCollins and exact release date (listings say 18 Nov 2025; one says Dec 2025) not confirmed. All 100 are men (book is billed as a ranking of the greatest male players)."
